                        "entry_id": "ceebca8c-ebe2-301f-b471-366da7dd8a58",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An edible pulse (Cicer arietinum), of the family Leguminosae or Fabaceae and subfamilies Faboideae or Papilionoideae, with white or purple-blue flowers and small feathery leaves on both sides of the stem and pods containing two to three peas."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2a7a2328-2eeb-4c6d-81f2-068087c4b9a5",
                                "sense_id": "65d37fd4-d0f9-3e9d-8149-8fd07506cc5b",
                                "text": "America when I was seven momma took me to Communist Cell meetings they sold us garbanzos a handful per ticket a ticket costs a nickel and the speeches were free[…]"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6c9bc41a-552d-3e5c-ade7-7fdeb1af8bbc",
                        "entry_id": "ceebca8c-ebe2-301f-b471-366da7dd8a58",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A seed of this plant; the chickpea."
